# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only inputs and build artifacts. These are the folders listed under
# "Safe to delete locally" in README.md - the install scripts recreate them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# WiFi credentials (copy secrets.h.example -> secrets.h)
secrets.h

# Arduino sketchbook and third-party libraries installed by the scripts.
# libraries/README.md is the only file in that folder that belongs in git.
.arduino/
.arduino15/
esp32/Agile_Tracker/libraries/*
!esp32/Agile_Tracker/libraries/README.md

# Cloned Waveshare reference repo
_waveshare_ref/

# Firmware build output
build/
*.bin
*.elf
*.map

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
preview/
tracker/lvgl8/
tracker/lvgl9/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
